note ASE 3.29.0 LennardJones rc=35 with the archived Hessian.py Newton loop, unmodified. Central difference 0.0005 Bohr, maxstep 0.25, stop at max per-atom force norm 0.01, xyz starts after center(100). The harness counts every calculator evaluation and stops at 10000. Every start reached the cap before that stop, so there is no success mean. force_calls 10000 is the harness total on every start. The archive 79 is the Newton loop index.
